{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/41587-cool-demon-names","id":41587,"title":"Cool Demon Names?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-03T01:58:33-08:00","id":41587,"title":"Cool Demon Names?","content":"What's inspiring your names? Got any particularly cool ones you want to share?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T06:35:58-08:00","id":41674,"title":"","content":"My group are taking a nice slow route to character creation, so we are still working it out. The 'Demon Names' for those who've gotten that far are currently;<ul><li><b>Miss Cord</b>; a Messenger sent to cause panic and despair. Currently working in the IT department of a telecommunications company.</li> <li><b>Mr. Rider</b>; a Fallen Psychopomp who wanted to keep his wheels.</li> <li><b>Ms. Law</b>; a Destroyer, now ex-cop, going to (budget) law school while on 'disability'/stress leave.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T07:57:29-08:00","id":41714,"title":"","content":"<b>Mr. Gear:</b> An Integrator Messenger sent to re-align a politician with the G-M's needs. Fell due to failure by interference by a Ring, he intends to earn his way back by achieving what he believes the intended purpose of the politician was.<br /> <b>Mr. Snow:</b> A Tempter Psychopomp who completed his mission and decided to experience what this creation of the G-M had to offer.<br /> <b>Ms. Tourniquet:</b> A Saboteur Guardian sent to contain an outbreak, but failed due to cross-purposes with a higher Ranked Angel. Sensing the effects of Angelic influence on the hospital she had infiltrated, she Fell out of confusion at the apparent betrayal. She continues her mission to save lives from the Earth's smallest organisms. Woe be unto any Destroyer Angels she comes across.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":1642,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","user":"Paddon","date":". 01-03-2014, 11:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T08:36:51-08:00","id":41732,"title":"","content":"<b>Mr. Tunnel: </b>An Inquisitor Psychopomp specializing in smuggling. His Fall stemmed from being too curious about the package, and getting caught up in the machinations. (Think Frank Martin from <i>The Transporter</i>)<br /> <b>Mr. Seal: </b>An Inquisitor Destroyer whose Mission was to ensure the timely death of a handful of senior citizens so their wealth would pass to the next generation at the right time. In ensuring it would succeed, he followed and interfered with a Ring investigating the outbreak, leading them to the politician who owned the medical labs that he had infiltrated (See <b>Mr. Gear</b>). The outbreak spread from the senior citizens' home to a local hospital, where he had to disrupt their treatment plans to ensure the deaths of his targets (See <b>Ms. Tourniquet</b>).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":1642,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","user":"Paddon","date":". 01-03-2014, 11:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T20:45:17-08:00","id":42133,"title":"","content":"My Group got it's first Integrator! Introducing;<ul><li><b>Mr. Sunday</b>; a Destroyer who found religion and intends to use it to bring the people and the G-M together. Sympathetic (outwardly at least), he's also very active in the local city...</li> <li><b>Smith</b>; a Guardian who Fell from failure shock when (Miss Cord) told the locals about the problems the Infrastructure it was defending would cause and they circumvented it. The least human Unchained in the group and is struggling to find it's own Identity. Notably, it's also the only one with two Covers and lacks what others would call a gender Identity.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T00:56:07-08:00","id":42759,"title":"","content":"I liked the method used in the DtD opening fiction. Where Zuriel was given the name: <b>Mr. Stone</b>. Fitting as Zuriel can be translated as &quot;God is my stone&quot; (stone as a source of strength and stability).<br /> Similarly Daniel can be translated as &quot;God is my Judge&quot; and thus <b>Judge</b> or <b>Mr. Law</b> or <b>Verdict</b>. Michael can be translated as &quot;Who is like God&quot; (a rhetorical question traditionally) and thus <b>Dr. Who</b> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> or <b>Question</b>. Raziel can become <b>Mr. Secret </b>and Ariel can be <b>Lion.</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1348-hecktar","name":"Hecktar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T08:12:18-08:00","id":42888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/41587-cool-demon-names#post41587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's inspiring your names? Got any particularly cool ones you want to share?</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Clavicules du Roi Solomonis</i>, in particular my character that Im developing <b>Gamaliel, AKA Pryor Walter, Prophet of the Millennium </b>(inspired by the play 'Angels in America').<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":311,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","user":"JoeB","date":". 01-05-2014, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T16:56:54-08:00","id":43225,"title":"","content":"Ms. Understanding, grinning through her teeth.<br /> <br /> Had to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T17:18:11-08:00","id":43234,"title":"","content":"<b>Aethelyaotl</b>: A mash-up of a name, it consists of the Anglo-Saxon word for &quot;noble&quot;, and a Nahuatl name meaning &quot;warrior&quot;. He is posing as a priest, and believes he is a crusader against the God Machine; he fell when he had a crisis of faith, seeing the suffering of his flock \u2014 the poorest of the poor in Mexico's slums \u2014 as something completely preventable if the God Machine cared more. He feels that the God Machine is a usurper of the One True God's power. In Aethelyaotl's eyes, if the Machine was brought down, then the One True God would show true compassion and mercy to the world, and create a kingdom on Earth as it might exist in heaven.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, he has a tendency to use methods in his &quot;crusade&quot; that come straight from the Spanish Inquisition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T22:52:12-08:00","id":43359,"title":"","content":"<b>Ms. Representation</b>, <b>Ms. Information</b>, and <b>Ms. Terri</b> all in <b>Ms. Understanding</b>'s ring, I think, right Arcane? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-06T10:15:05-08:00","id":43592,"title":"","content":"<b>Ms. Spindle: </b>A Pshychopomp whose role was to become the gear in certain human functions and then steer it as if it were a spindle of a wheel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-06T11:37:59-08:00","id":43633,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paddon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/41587-cool-demon-names?p=43359#post43359\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Ms. Representation</b>, <b>Ms. Information</b>, and <b>Ms. Terri</b> all in <b>Ms. Understanding</b>'s ring, I think, right Arcane? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Quite Right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-08T17:12:05-08:00","id":45231,"title":"","content":"I may be the only one to have no mister or mrs. names in my groups. One setting, Las Vegas, leans more towards the traditional. The main PCs go by Manus, Animus, and Sophis. I don't recall where my friend got the idea, but they translate sorta to hand, spirit, and knowledge. In the other game, more modernized and tech heavy, the demons are Morpheus (he was a sleeper agent) and the Incubus. For the latter, it was originally just a filler title, but eventually it sounded more epic as his actual name and reputation. Plus, his boyfriend likes to call him Inky.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-11T22:05:12-08:00","id":47251,"title":"","content":"I find it a little distressing we got this far without mentioning the infamous Saboteur <b>Ms. Fire</b>. <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">:P</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-11T23:57:06-08:00","id":47273,"title":"","content":"I'm amazed nobody mentioned that incorrigible Inquisitor <b>Mr. E</b> yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-12T11:22:05-08:00","id":47500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Grim Lich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/41587-cool-demon-names?p=47273#post47273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm amazed nobody mentioned that incorrigible Inquisitor <b>Mr. E</b> yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's because his cover is about as subtle as a purple &amp; green brick to the face <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-12T22:27:30-08:00","id":47933,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:18px\">Kannon-sama, aka Mr. Buddha, a Messenger Tempter that fell shortly after Urging a perfectly decent mortal into completely discarding their humanity in order to start up a zaibatsu specialized in living Infrastructure. (Arm of Kannon is one of my favourite mangas. The main bad guys are like a joint Pentex/Progenitor/Iteration X R&amp;D lab, ran by a hardcore Infernalist. Just like the idea of the Arm and Grail being the necessary pieces of Infrastructure to summon an Angel, and that Angel being a possessor that feeds on its victim's Integrity, so I ask, what if it found a soul so delectable that it feels remorse and that causes the Fall?)</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T20:56:36-08:00","id":48700,"title":"","content":"Mr. Ection, a Trumpet who Fell for telling the truth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-17T18:56:16-08:00","id":52057,"title":"","content":"how about Bob","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"